  "details": "So far since the large patch on the 7th of August (Build 1680) I've had this occur randomly on about 5 different occasions, there was also one additional occasion where this happened when I was on one of the beta builds leading up to 1680\n\nI've not been able to deduct a cause, but what I can say is that once the leak starts, it rapidly increases, going from 9gb to the 42gb seen in the screenshot in the span of about 15 minutes, this case also happened while alone in a highly optimized world\n\nIt at least appears to be somewhat rare at least but that makes it harder to figure out the cause along with the randomness",
